  (text "PREAMP  -- 2x JFET common-source (MMBF5457). Rs placed 2K2 (recovered); ~1-1.2k for the 8-9V drain target (errata #15). C_s1 / C_s2 are a VOICING option, default NOT fitted: none = 21 dB, clean to ~0.3 V pk; C_s1 only = 33 dB, breaks up above ~0.1 V; both = 45 dB, 8 % THD at 20 mV (spice/tran_preamp_headroom.cir, errata #28)" (at 145.25 13.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 4e57ecf0-9344-4dbd-91da-40adb9a662c7))
